    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλωπ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>adorning oneself, making a
				display</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				572c
			</span></i>; <i>showing off</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πρὸς
				ἵππους κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				10.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				349c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ornamentation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φορτικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Medic.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς κ</span>. for
			<i>ornament</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.9.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλωπισμοὶ οἱ περὶ τὸ σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					64d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>making euphonious</i>, of words, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				414c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				426d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>embellishment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Steph.
					<u>in Hp.</u>
					2.419D.
				</span></i>
			</div>
